#: scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f68539c26c9c3fe85f3d12814b6797dab7e8a485a471bb55baaa9e2c715fb3f6
#. default-sha256: 8db06c0cf6e34fa4070b95ce7c7376b5d6e80cdd7d20f96230aad2491c34c169
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The next morning, Jacopo stood alone in the den by the billiards "
"table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Le lendemain matin, Jacopo se trouvait, seul, dans la salle de jeux "
"près du billard."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a292cc515f126cac4ee0e95da7fc04f00ecf15671d4894d7e7f051ed0e4062a4
#. default-sha256: 1b1465148406a528ddc159ce7bfee09e69c54562d7f25e35eea5f6471a8faf61
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He appeared to be rather agitated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il semblait assez agité."

#: scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4eca00dc588604fc9bf7a8de6bbfd9ace05f5d7026706faee0be434eb1b27d62
#. default-sha256: 3ba8a2e829100396407ebab2609df3c974e4fa9992452c3a663d530dc8eee979
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His face was twisted into a frown, his pointer finger tapping restlessly against the hard "
"surface of the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il fronçait les sourcils et tapait nerveusement de son index la surface dure de la table."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aeefc588985ece57be4b0ea8da2bf9b4c3bb98c9c8dcfdf6a9ea9182455ca73a
#. default-sha256: b8b67445443247bd62ea2d0d7ca5e10d09a0e0e87fc92c5ca134d6c52586ab55
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Evidently no longer able to stay in one place,⟪k:1⟫he paced a circle around the table,⟪k:2⟫"
"then swiped up a rack and a cue,⟪k:3⟫setting up a game of nine-ball."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫N’y tenant plus, de toute évidence,⟪k:1⟫il se mit à faire les cent pas autour de la table,"
"⟪k:2⟫fit monter le râtelier, prit une queue⟪k:3⟫et installa un jeu de neuf boules."

#: scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7db03f40e30a7c0b70eff98e18b6eb20098f2660f5786b234c979459920cd178
#. default-sha256: c91a1b25cfc322ed2f436e7ff9f3511a4af638ed26cb8fe54b1059791dc1da55
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am not intimately familiar with the ways by which men entertain themselves, but in truth, "
"I was bewitched by the sight of him leaning over the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne connais pas très bien les divertissements des hommes mais en vérité j’étais fascinée "
"de le voir se pencher sur la table."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 106b9f18275e016a9fbdad9cefe8a8756eafc75a610b6c7ddecd0b1b7601c4d1
#. default-sha256: 9d57a82a384b4c236dd49f83560edff30367f1e65a1f1b04d904e77d90d8931a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It almost seemed as though a steel rod ran straight from his shoulder to the tip of his "
"outstretched finger, upon which the cue was secured by another finger looped over it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On aurait presque dit qu’il avait une tige d’acier qui le traversait de l’épaule au bout de "
"son doigt tendu ; à cet endroit, la queue de billard était maintenue par un autre doigt qui "
"l’entourait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0d5642b6b6cdc0de1d53153a245a21a125285cf07cd7ac26978419d0a1fade5
#. default-sha256: baedc9ba1d47796b33df9f2e58e1e4a97a166d93405e0d360b26f91a8983edb6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a smooth, flowing motion, he thrust the cue forward slightly, pulling it back and "
"repeating the process once more..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫D’un geste doux, fluide, il la fit glisser en avant puis en arrière et répéta le processus "
"une seconde fois..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2c73ff70a03819478f7576b9ba8cc9edbe96fe7bf33be6f36dbe2236b8d5da4
#. default-sha256: e0e0d242102218cabc7af73d34d0134ba2bbae2362933cd5bb59290fba774c76
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫before ramming it into the cue ball, sending it rolling into the diamond of colored "
"balls. ⟪k:2⟫A chorus of ⟪k:3⟫click⟪k:4⟫s and ⟪k:5⟫clack⟪k:6⟫s emanated from the center of the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...avant de percuter la boule de billard et de l’envoyer rouler dans les coins de la "
"table. ⟪k:2⟫Un chœur de claquements émana du centre de la pièce."

#: scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8323f0b5759fd1a40d962f4c524279c784345a5bfdb3019e0a6053784830c42
#. default-sha256: 8c62b1556c6872ea3be4c9435f851bb5bb33103fbff87eb5c4b1bbf90a4c58c7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Balls collided with one another and ricocheted off the cushioned walls, a few landing in the "
"pockets situated around the edge of the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les boules se heurtèrent les unes les autres et ricochèrent le long des murs rembourrés ; "
"quelques-unes disparurent dans les trous situés aux angles de la table."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6663055c2a3fb3d969e1bd95207bf357f3e1eb5020d5317bfd418ecfb30bda6
#. default-sha256: 074242cb87256d205e15fae8cc1bc7675017ae16b193151eb5926f4d834f6eeb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo appeared to have accomplished this with little trouble, but I imagine merely striking "
"the cue ball with the stick would be rather difficult for someone inexperienced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo semblait avoir accompli cela sans trop de difficulté mais je pense que le seul fait "
"de frapper la boule avec la baguette devait être assez compliqué pour quelqu’un d’inexpérimenté."

#: scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ded8243fe2a41d4918311c6ad6263d842fffb89f509929f98b89778e43ef79e0
#. default-sha256: 0cdb75a383903cf649cbfb44e535dac7a86af5cc29a1a9c74d7280ca0139cf88
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But despite his accomplishment, it seemed to only exacerbate his agitation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Malgré cela, Jacopo semblait encore plus agité."

#: scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49e90730c977bd115ec623e59eece5ba14e78a2b08d53897c40560ae265994fb
#. default-sha256: e345686adb391733bfdfd996915bcba3104798f12ac501edf9f38e52e323cd2c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Lousy positioning,” he muttered, though I hadn’t the faintest idea what he was talking "
"about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Mauvais positionnement », murmura-t-il, bien que je n’aie pas la moindre idée de ce dont "
"il parlait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0695484e428788443b6bc6c7f8bf488e81b60060e441b8be9ecd2e70a8cad95
#. default-sha256: 8762ec3d2b80c2fc520d38ab8a8049066e04febabd05843af2f8a476937dd9be
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What should have been a game for his enjoyment, he went about with a constant look of "
"exasperation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Loin d’être amusé, il fit toute la partie sans se départir de son air exaspéré."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec0afef0e552e2f8309bc93b584303f1224cd7a032592395bf1fbdcbe74666ea
#. default-sha256: c7316001c58de6607356e0ccc6306c401a7ae7b0db1fa12c3951fa1bb00b8b7f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suspect he was using it as a way to blow off steam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je suppose qu’il jouait pour se défouler."

#: scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55e3816daea5e6ecfa3aaf759f3044f3db8ee2bb86c36eead6b77fb51b4a478c
#. default-sha256: 8ee1705c555ae75a9274b7b255abdf2fcc76a6128a6d38e84ed6bf9c45fd6c20
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as a result, the tension in the air was palpable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et donc, on sentait de la tension dans l’air."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5994f6fcc9e4aaae57ce4d2b47055472025feabee0d98abd24a5e81578579326
#. default-sha256: 28c400816bdb332f1a2c33fb0042f7ed9f847f2faaa97af21b2d96a35350aaac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt it would be improper to intrude upon him, even considering my distaste for the man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Malgré mon dédain pour lui, je sentais bien qu’il n’aurait pas été convenable de le déranger."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3567b457ebf2c8fb25a502bd81f0599d5adbb600da0fb3d760dd87682f8394f7
#. default-sha256: d4172af42be737f0655de69caddec8b702cb2c8f44cf7ab4769dc58a677f4584
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was an undeniable beauty in every motion he made, every perfectly audible ⟪k:1⟫"
"clack⟪k:2⟫ of billiards balls bouncing off one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une beauté indéniable se dégageait de chacun de ses mouvements, de chaque ⟪k:1⟫clac⟪k:2⟫ des "
"boules de billards qui rebondissaient."

#: scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48a9f2ddc0efd117c29227da7d758f406f5c2b745241660c222b8ad5817f35cf
#. default-sha256: bf3e8c363c2ba3f64b8bdcb43ae605000a543f23d9d31441631e6a5466257bc4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was... ⟪k:1⟫an enchanting sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’était... ⟪k:1⟫enchanteur à regarder."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93d9082072251ff13e5b3c238dc83e3cb3e8a151f0eb1207698049bf630c7259
#. default-sha256: 23ae782e114ddcad1d3c3494e88fd0a94ba56f0629225e0c3af80316de9eeb79
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But then, someone without the slightest regard or appreciation for beauty came marching in "
"with a hammer to shatter it like glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est alors qu’une personne sans aucune considération pour la beauté entra, tel un éléphant "
"dans un magasin de porcelaine, et brisa le charme."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2168d9dee2fc5e04f447a5979315568eb2b5f237b4373997a6992d530dce2043
#. default-sha256: a5d9230f3e7d105e77eb986f4378990c91c7299b270b35f0d3b52d37c68acecb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotta say, that was pretty impressive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫J’dois dire, c’était plutôt impressionnant."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 471b860f74dac0b88dd92d066df272fe2f701d750584d7de374afe096ce3c9bf
#. default-sha256: d5413f510812c33b161c877dd39ab1f60a3a60730b00e17afea4ba1438db3df9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78172905da24502f2af42333ee1f7cbbf3dcd14f91078687313a9e74a5284f3c
#. default-sha256: 5a1ae1862bf0ac5d034eccf3a153b1d2ef4c8b1ce8c886faf7301d5e2d06f040
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A man leaned against the frame of the open door—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was neither a resident nor "
"worker of the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un homme s’appuyait contre le rebord de la porte—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ ce n’était ni un habitant ni un "
"ouvrier du manoir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07ff18053552ef3576cd8e36ac7e39592025140351c5f6bc86f15782889aa497
#. default-sha256: 2b9fe2ede3f102c61723eea43d24d0fbef271cfda39c650b5b203d6d949026a8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man’s face was covered in scraggly stubble, his body draped in grime-caked garments. "
"⟪k:1⟫His eyes were sunken so deep it was as though I was looking at a fleshless skull—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"though there was a feral glimmer in them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait une barbe de plusieurs jours mal taillée et son corps était recouvert de haillons à "
"faire peur. ⟪k:1⟫Il avait des yeux tellement enfoncés que j’avais l’impression de regarder un "
"crâne—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ à ceci près qu’une lueur sauvage y brillait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a7fc8d0cd27a74f237c272643aede37936211b2270214a2b049afd7d68ab1ef
#. default-sha256: 870d611c87a062358e4ef8c1b1d8fd268a144b7e84cc6c2b09b71acba5939a3c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Needless to say, he was not prim and proper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il n’était pas bien comme il faut, cela va sans dire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1292524c1556305527fac1d9cf6301cc19d0d9d09a44d5b644db439e01decd3b
#. default-sha256: f9de63a873e53fab7ef88e2f1c232a32e4876e972dbfc1f1c0a9df2f300a205e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How long have you been there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ça fait longtemps que tu es là ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78016ff5753c379f62bc53826109aff3c1cda1c6f91f365c394e6cf0367bf1c1
#. default-sha256: 824f3f627a18d38eeb9c2de80298ad7c645ed0a8d372a2d0fc4263f4bf0dd6c3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Not long. But man, I can’t help laughin’.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You were ⟪k:6⟫"
"completely⟪k:7⟫ in your own world there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Nan. Mais j’te dis, j’peux pas m’empêcher de rigoler.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫T’étais ⟪k:6⟫"
"totalement⟪k:7⟫ dans ton monde, là."

#: scenario3:scenario3_13D5D87F_9F1C_4BB0_8B1B_96D89F0B7219
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02753050b3c6296c6c5eb5d9a057578735a99ce8a20b5f7f333d5d4fa7d19e66
#. default-sha256: 2f30ef739aa398b4275d4b582b24657c28723ceb65bbd6e37f80c956402979ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_13D5D87F_9F1C_4BB0_8B1B_96D89F0B7219"
